Hi!<br />
<br />
Thank you for contacting the American Red Cross and your interest in our Leaders Save Lives. &nbsp;The American Red Cross needs student leaders like yourself to help support the blood supply this summer. &nbsp;Over 20 percent of all blood donations are by High School and College students. &nbsp; When young donors are on summer break they often do not donate. &nbsp;You can help change that with your leadership!<br />
<br />
Based on the number of units your blood drive collects you can earn Amazon Gift Cards and a chance to win scholarship dollars! &nbsp;<br />
<br />
We can help get you started. &nbsp;You will need to secure a blood drive location. &nbsp;It will need to be 1000 square feet of open, usable space, with A/C, good lighting and electrical power. &nbsp;(Such as a Church Fellowship Hall, Community Center, Gym, etc.) &nbsp;<br />
<br />
Then we will need 30-35 people interested in donating to secure a blood drive date. &nbsp;(To qualify for any of the prizes you drive must collect 25 units or more. To reach that number you will need at least 30-35 people interested in donating.) &nbsp;<br />
<br />
Let me know if you think you can achieve the above and we will be in contact to help get you started!<br />
<br />
Attached is information on the Leaders Save Lives Program, The Successful Blood Drive Guide, and a sample Interest Survey.<br />
<br />
Best Regards,<br />
